Z||000000||DrRodey||11-01-2000||05:11 PM||||Lately many MANY people have been asking me if it Built my convetable myself or if i bought it... The answer is  &gt;&gt;&gt;I did it my self&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt; Found the top in the corner of a shed at one of my favorite junk yards took some measurements and it basically fit so i bought it choped the top and attached the convo.  For Pix check out my website... <A HREF="http://freepages.ugo.com/RodeysPlace/HomePlace.html" TARGET=_blank>RodeysPlace</A><BR>Any questions or for more info E-mail me @<BR>RodeyJW94@yahoo.com  <P>Thanks for your intrest in My baby and all the info y'all have given me.  I hope i can repay the favor in the future and I'll be seeing ya at the shows and around town.. Peace peoples...<P>Rodey<P>------------------<BR>'88 Formula CONVERTABLE<BR>'85 Coupe<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://freepages.ugo.com/RodeysPlace/files/smallfc.JPG">  <BR> <A HREF="http://freepages.ugo.com/RodeysPlace/HomePlace.html" TARGET=_blank>freepages.ugo.com/RodeysPlace/HomePlace.html</A> <p>[This message has been edited by DrRodey (edited 11-01-2000).]||||reg||3
